launch-video
============

This repository contains the launch-video harness: the routing skill, the
review gate, the runbook, and the evaluation artifacts from our first
end-to-end test.

The local render engines the harness drives are NOT included in this
repository. They are third-party tools pulled in separately for local
testing and are excluded via .gitignore. This repo is the method and the
quality gate — not the engines themselves.

